==Lithuanian==

===Etymology===
Ultimately borrowed from {{bor|lt|la|acadēmīa}}, itself a [[borrowing]] from {{der|lt|grc|Ἀκαδημία}}, a grove of trees and gymnasium outside of Athens where [[w:Plato|Plato]] taught; from the name of the supposed former owner of that estate, the [[w:Attica|Attic]] hero [[w:Akademos|Akademos]].

